From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Kristof Imeri <kristof@lanth.me>
Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 04:02:01 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] compositor: blur app glass that frames a sheet only around
 the glass

A glass region around an opaque sheet has the whole window as its
extents, so the blur read and blurred all of it, and what is under the
sheet had to be drawn for the blur to read. The blur now draws each of
its steps only within its reach of the glass, and the window culls
everything under its opaque region except that reach around the glass,
which the redraw clip covers whenever the glass blurs again.

Upstream-Status: luft-only builds on Kestrel's kept app glass
